{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:35 2026-05-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:35 2026-05-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:35 2026-05-27 HKT</p><p>今日（27日）早上8時33分，深水埗欽州街65號對開一工地發生工業意外，一名年約60歲男工人於工作期間，突然遭一部由約3米高處跌下的電動鏈式吊機，擊中頭部。他登時倒地昏迷，工友見狀大驚報警。人員接報到場，將傷者急送瑪嘉烈醫院搶救。</p><img alt=\"警員列作工業意外調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3952b74ff48cdc9b7be81c0298c371b4/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065.jpg\"/><img alt=\"意外發生於深水埗欽州街65號對開工地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a2e97cfb8364c41d996b8106a5cd3357/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"工人被電動鏈式吊機擊中昏迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54f367e7d93ab77f1ed5b8da702ecf3b/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065_08.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33d393e93b615a50f30b6194faaafb5c/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a9e5053cc4cdf20eb94fe62859129ce0/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065_04.jpg\"/><p>現場所見，工地圍板印有渠務署標誌。據悉事發時工地內正進行吊運工序，其間一部電動鏈式吊機在滑道上大約3米高處跌下，擊傷工人頭部。警方列作工業意外，正調查事件。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/647be5f819e46b3987b9f6fce63d2228/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065_06.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員在現場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f17350143d5e12169a0f8cacfb945d0/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065_10.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b29995e2135a41f513a32f7af7653d68/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065_11.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89883803f8b921649dc70ef706a506f8/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065_12.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3696bd620996a53c64f1e0489610f035/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260527_100404065_13.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T04:55:50.117365+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}